    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale nze eyasibwa olw'okugheereza Musengwa, mbeeghemba mwebise mu nsambo egwanira obulamu bwe mwayeterwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mube bawombeefu, abatali ba ikabyo era abaguminkiriza. Mulage okugonzania kwaimwe, nga buli muntu aguminkiriza mwine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.12+COL.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mufube okukalangula okwisa ekirala Mwoyo kw'abagheera mu miraala egibayunga aghalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omubiri guli mulala, ni Mwoyo mulala, ng'era ekisuubizo kye mwayeterwa bwekiri ekirala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa mulala, okwikiriza kulala n'okubatizibwa kulala ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda mulala, Lata w'abantu boonaboona, afuga byonabyona, akolera mu byonabyona, era aba mu byonabyona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye buli mulala mu ife yagheebwa ekirabo eky'endhawulo nga Kurisito bwe yamugerera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyaghandiikibwa kye biva ni bikoba biti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.68.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 68:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kye nhenda okubakobera, era nga mbasikirira mu Musengwa, ni kino: Mukange agho okwebisa ng'abamaghanga agandi bwe beebisa, nga bajiira ku birowoozo byaibwe ebiziramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyoyo gyaibwe giidhwire nzikiiza. Bazira mugabo mu bya bulamu Katonda bw'agaba, kuba baidhwire obutamanha, era emyoyo gyaibwe mikalangafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibakaali na nsoni beemaliire mu bya budankaanu, balulunkanira okukola ebibi ebya buli nsambo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye imwe Kurisito ti bwe mwamwega mutyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkakasa nga mwamuwuliraku, era imwe ng'ababe, mwayegeresebwa amazima agali mu Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mwesambe obulamu obw'eira bwe mwalimu, obwayoneka n'okwegomba kwabwo okuguya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwizibwe buyaaka mu myoyo ni mu bidhuubo byaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mufuuke bantu bayaaka, abaatondebwa mu kifaananie kya Katonda mu bwesimbu ni mu butukuvu obw'amazima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.1.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 1:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ni mulekere okuguya buli muntu akobere mwine amazima, kuba tuli bitundu bya mubiri mulala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 8:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe musungughala, obusungu butabasindikanga mu kwona. Mutagwisanga ndhuba nga mukaasibye obusungu ku mwoyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era mutaghanga Sitaani kaghagaanhia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaire aiba akange agho, aye afube kukola ng'akozesa emikono gye asobole n'okugabiraku abaavu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eminwa gyaimwe girobenga kwogera bibono bitasaana, aye gyogerenga ebyo byonka ebikalamu ebizimba era ebisaine, bisobole okuleetera ababiwulira emikisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mutanakughazanga Mwoyo Mutukuvu wa Katonda, kuba Mwoyo n'akamanhiso ke mwateebwaku okutuuka ku lunaku olw'okununulibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulekeyo enge, ekiruyi, obusungu, okwereega, okuvumagana n'okukyaghagana kwonakwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mubenga ba kisa, buli muntu alumirwenga mwine, era musonighaganenga nga Katonda bwe yabasonigha mu Kurisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
